+# williamaaronturner.com
+
+Static personal site for William Aaron Turner, founder of Infinitum Corporation (Washington, DC).
+- Deploy as a static site on Vercel. `*.vercel.app` hosts send `X-Robots-Tag: noindex` so previews are not indexed; the production domain is indexable.
+- Go-live: point williamaaronturner.com (apex) and www at this Vercel project (DNS at the current registrar; currently served by Beacons). `www` 301s to apex.
+- Only public phone: 202-729-9509. Entity @ids match theinfinitumcorporation.com JSON-LD.
