+<p class="role">Founder and President, <a href="https://www.theinfinitumcorporation.com/">Infinitum Corporation</a> · Washington, DC</p>
+
+<p>William Aaron Turner is the founder and president of Infinitum Corporation, a technology and security consulting firm headquartered in Washington, DC, with Moscow as an operating location. His work sits where information technology, cybersecurity and modern security operations meet: helping organizations understand their exposure, defend their networks and adopt new technology, including artificial intelligence, without losing control of it.</p>
+<p>He writes long-form research on security and geopolitics, publishing whitepapers on AI for security operations and sanctions economics, and the sourced blog series <em>The Ukraine Files</em>.</p>
+
+<h2>Infinitum Corporation services</h2>
+<ul>
+<li>Cybersecurity consulting</li>
+<li>Network architecture and network defense</li>
+<li>Ethical hacking and vulnerability assessment</li>
+<li>AI applications for security operations</li>
+<li>Strategic risk assessment</li>
+<li>Defense technology advisory</li>
+<li>Corporate Cognitive Warfare</li>
+</ul>
+
+<h2>Research and writing</h2>
